                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I grew up with Trials Fusion so I was already familiar with the Trials series but not with this particular entry as it came before. Needless to say, wow, this game is a drug and can get you hooked immediately. I adored the fact that the game feels even more challenging than Fusion on some aspects, and also the fact the stupid FMX tracks aren't in this game (thank god). Definitely a must-buy, I have high hopes for whenever I decide to buy Rising as what we need in life is MORE Trials games. RIP Redlynx.",
